        itemId = 43824,
        name = "The Schools of Arcane Magic - Mastery",
        stepCount = 12,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Find all eight correct Dalaran books among decoys and multi-hour respawns for Higher Learning.\n\n1. Go to Dalaran above Crystalsong Forest and track Higher Learning (1956). If you already completed it, check the Toy Box first, then skip to step 11 for recovery. The book hunt takes place in Northrend Dalaran, not the Broken Isles city.\n\n2. At the Legerdemain Lounge (46.9, 39.8), look in the downstairs empty bookcase by the stove for The Schools of Arcane Magic - Transmutation. Read the genuine title and check its criterion; an unrelated book is only a placeholder.\n\n3. Go upstairs in the same inn to the western bedroom (46.9, 39.3). Read Necromancy from its empty bookcase. This is a different spawn from the downstairs book, despite their nearly identical map positions.\n\n4. Enter Threads of Fate at 43.5, 47.0, go upstairs and step onto the balcony. Enchantment appears on a crate outside; searching the ground-floor shop misses this spawn.\n\n5. Enter the Violet Citadel (30.9, 46.3). Read Conjuration at the bottom of the bookcase on your right as you face into the main room. Stay downstairs for this book.\n\n6. Take the Citadel stairs up to 26.5, 51.7. Divination appears on the floor between the bookcases near the old Caverns of Time portal area. It is upstairs, separate from Conjuration.\n\n7. At the Dalaran Visitor Center (52.2, 55.5), check the floor to the right inside the entrance, beside the small table and chair, for Abjuration.\n\n8. Outside the Violet Hold (64.5, 52.8), check the crate against the wall beside Archmage Timear for Illusion. Stay in the entrance courtyard; no dungeon clear is needed.\n\n9. Go inside the Violet Gate's teleportation-crystal room (56.5, 45.8). Introduction lies on the floor beside the northern bookcase, on your right as you enter.\n\n10. Repeat only your missing locations. Read placeholder books too so their spawn can cycle; books usually disappear a few minutes after being opened and replacements can take hours. Share genuine-book sightings promptly because several players can read the same spawn.\n\n11. When all eight criteria complete, collect the Mastery book from the achievement mail and use it to learn the toy. If an older completion has no book, speak to Rhonin inside the Violet Citadel (30.5, 48.4) on the character that completed Higher Learning. Check that character's bank before requesting another copy.\n\n12. Activate the toy while in Northrend Dalaran to visit Vargoth's retreat. Speak to Vargoth there for the additional Kirin Tor Familiar pet, then activate the book again to leave. The pet conversation needs the character that read the books.",
