        itemId = 44430,
        name = "Titanium Seal of Dalaran",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Fish the fountain's three coin checklists; duplicates and random coin selection can extend the session.\n\n1. Travel to Northrend Dalaran and find the fountain in the Eventide at about 52.6, 66.5. Track The Coin Master (2096) and its three coin achievements. The Legion fountain has a different coin collection.\n\n2. Stand a little back from the rim, face the water and cast into the fountain. Catch every named coin required by A Penny For Your Thoughts (copper), Silver in the City, and There Is Gold In That There Fountain. Buying or receiving coins from another player does not replace fishing them yourself.\n\n3. Whenever you catch a gold coin, use it beside the fountain to obtain the two-minute Lucky buff. Refresh after it expires; using several at once does not extend it. Let each catch finish looting before recasting.\n\n4. Keep checking the missing coin names in each criterion list. Duplicate coins are normal and the final missing name can take much longer than the others. Vendor spare copper and silver coins for bag space; keep spare gold coins for Lucky.\n\n5. After the meta completes, check the Toy Box: Retail reports include direct automatic learning rather than an item in the mail. If the toy is still missing, check the completion character's mail and speak to Jepetto Joybuzz in The Wonderworks (44.6, 45.8) about a replacement.",
        sourceType = "Achievements",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=44430",
        difficultyReason = "Fish the fountain's three coin checklists; duplicates and random coin selection can extend the session.",
        difficulty = "medium",
    },
    [44606] = {
